{#
  Founders Special. Two shapes of one offer, set with `fsVariant` before including:
    "announce"  the compact panel in the home hero
    "callout"   the full statement beside the packages

  The open-spot count is read from site.foundersSpecial.spots, so the chip in
  every placement is one hand edit in site.json. A spot is only taken once the
  Client Services Agreement is signed AND the 50% deposit has arrived; nobody
  updates the number on an inquiry. Setting it to 0 renders nothing at all.

  Both CTAs point at the plain contact route on purpose. No price, percentage
  or extra term appears here: the founding-client figure is quoted per project.
#}
{%- set fsSpots = site.foundersSpecial.spots %}
{%- if fsSpots %}
{%- set fsChip = fsSpots + " spot" + ("s" if fsSpots != 1) + " available" %}

{%- if fsVariant == "announce" %}
<aside class="founders founders-announce" aria-label="Founders Special">
  <div class="founders-head">
    <p class="founders-title">Founders Special</p>
    <span class="founders-chip">{{ fsChip }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="founders-text">To celebrate the launch of ALVSolutions, the first 3 new clients can receive special founding-client pricing.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/">Start a project</a>
</aside>

{%- else %}
<section class="founders founders-callout reveal" aria-labelledby="founders-heading">
  <div class="founders-offer">
    <div class="founders-head">
      <h2 id="founders-heading">Founders Special</h2>
      <span class="founders-chip">{{ fsChip }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">ALVSolutions is officially open for business.</p>
    <p class="body-2">To kick things off, I'm offering special founding-client pricing to the first 3 new clients who start a project with ALVSolutions.</p>
    <p class="body-2">You'll receive the same professional service, project scope, and support, just at special founding-client pricing.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="founders-terms">
    <p class="founders-limit">Limited to 3 new-client spots.</p>
    <p class="rail-foot">
      <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
      <span>A spot is secured once the Client Services Agreement is signed and the required 50% project deposit is received.</span>
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Start your project</a>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
